WEBVTT

00:02:51.276 --> 00:02:54.056
somewhere near him. If you're sure you're all right, I'll look for him.

00:02:54.348 --> 00:02:55.928
Of course I am. I'll walk over to the road.

00:02:56.428 --> 00:02:56.768
Okay.

00:03:33.196 --> 00:03:33.976
to town, mister.

00:03:34.288 --> 00:03:35.488
Sure, hop in.

00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:05.720
Don't argue. Step on it.

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:07.310
Huh? Are you crazy?

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:09.310
Don't argue. Step on it.

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:39.880
stopped him.

00:05:03.480 --> 00:05:24.400
must report to the moon calling reddick calling reddick rob calling reddick

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.970
I have to report another failure, Your Excellency.

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:36.550
We were unable to capture Commando Cody and hold him for ransom.

00:05:37.030 --> 00:05:38.410
You still have no funds?

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:41.840
No, sir. And until we can get a ray gun into action again,

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:44.800
we are unable to continue our campaign against Earth's defenses.

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:50.290
Listen carefully, Krog. I cannot have my preparations for invading the Earth.

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:53.900
Delayed by such a minor detail as obtaining a small amount of money.

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:57.420
If the men you now have cannot accomplish this simple mission,

00:05:58.020 --> 00:05:59.980
then hire someone who can produce results.

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:03.530
I understand, Your Excellency.

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:17.070
It's up to you to decide whether you can still be useful to us or...

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:19.800
We'll figure something out.

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:24.920
Remember that payroll job Duke was trying to get you in on?

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:27.040
Maybe he'll still go through with it.

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:29.560
Well?

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:32.620
It's risky, but it might work.

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:35.200
It's the Western Wholesale Supply Company.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.320
They keep their payroll in the office safe every Friday night.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:41.590
There's a man in the office who knows the combination.

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:00.920
keep going

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:05.750
closer. You can't get caught with the payroll, Alice. Watch where I throw it. We'll pick it up later.

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:45.600
finally got a break they called me down to the jail hospital to see if i could identify a prisoner

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:49.500
and he turned out to be one of those two who've been making all the trouble for us well how did

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:53.720
they catch him well he and another man staged a payroll robbery the police went after them and

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:58.260
the car crashed the other man was killed but our pal was only banged up a little what did you find

00:08:58.260 --> 00:08:59.970
out about him his name

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:03.190
My name's Graber. He's an ex-convict, out on parole, from a bank robbery sentence.

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:05.900
What about his connection with the invaders from the moon?

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:07.940
I haven't had a chance to find out yet.

00:09:08.550 --> 00:09:10.370
There were too many people around the jail hospital,

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:13.590
so Henderson asked me not to question him there. We might be overheard.

00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:16.160
But aren't they going to try to find out something?

00:09:16.520 --> 00:09:19.830
Yes. They're going to move him under guard to a private sanitarium,

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:22.940
where we can question him without any danger of the story leaking out

00:09:22.940 --> 00:09:24.960
and throwing the whole country into a panic.

00:09:25.390 --> 00:09:26.050
When will that be?

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:27.600
Probably this afternoon.

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:29.840
Henderson is going to let me know as soon as they make arrangements.

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:39.890
having him transferred i'd like you to go with me ted sure i got some news about graver a friend

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:43.710
of mine's a trustee in the jail hospital and he tipped me off there moving graver out in an

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:48.210
ambulance this afternoon is there anything we can do about it yeah i got it all figured out

00:09:48.210 --> 00:09:51.940
now my friend told me which road the ambulance is taking and i'll

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:17.960
Start walking.

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:18.860
Cross country.

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:38.630
What about the driver?

00:10:38.940 --> 00:10:39.580
I said I'm hiking.

00:10:40.010 --> 00:10:40.770
You should have slugged him.

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:42.910
As soon as he gets to a phone, he'll have the cops on our train.

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:43.630
Nah, it's okay.

00:10:43.970 --> 00:10:46.210
There's a car parked a few miles up the road to pick you up.

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:47.010
Okay, let's go.

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:23.200
you got here the cops are after you already what yeah it's coming over the radio right now

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:29.440
calling all cars calling all cars

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:34.210
an ambulance was last reported turning on to the east end of harrison canyon highway

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:39.200
i told you you should have slugged that driver calling police headquarters calling police

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:45.700
headquarters it's cody police headquarters come in this is commando cody picked up your broadcast

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:50.190
and i'm just turning into the west end of harrison canyon now if i meet the ambulance i'll stop it

00:11:50.190 --> 00:11:55.700
for you we'll get some men up there soon as we can it's a bad break what's he doing out here

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:57.760
Probably on his way to third-degree me.

00:11:58.310 --> 00:11:59.550
I'll go back to town with you, Sam.

00:12:00.156 --> 00:12:01.896
Keep going with the ambulance until you can ditch it.

00:12:02.204 --> 00:12:03.824
If you meet Cody first, smash him.

00:12:04.060 --> 00:12:04.360
Right.

00:12:28.284 --> 00:12:29.124
We'll meet them on the road.

00:12:30.092 --> 00:12:31.032
Got a good chance to.
